    "the structure.",
    "Separate from that",
    "decision,",
    "Gustave Eiffel",
    "made the tower",
    "available",
    "to military engineer",
    "Gustave Ferrié",
    "for radio research",
    "and helped fund",
    "the work.",
    "Ferrié",
    "and his team",
    "placed the equipment",
    "in a",
    "wooden room",
